---
// About.astro — About section
---

<section
  id="about"
  class="about-section section-py bg-cream"
  aria-labelledby="about-heading"
>
  <div class="container-base">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <!-- Image column -->
      <div class="about-image-col reveal-fade">
        <div class="about-image-wrap">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1447933601403-0c6688de566e?w=800&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt="Barista sedang menyeduh kopi dengan metode pour over di meja kayu"
            width="800"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="about-img"
          />
          <!-- Decorative caption -->
          <div class="about-img-caption" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>Since [YEAR]</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Small accent image -->
        <div class="about-accent-img reveal-fade delay-200" aria-hidden="true">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514432324607-a09d9b4aefdd?w=400&q=80&auto=format&fit=crop"
            alt=""
            width="400"
            height="320"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text column -->
      <div class="about-text-col">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal mb-5">Our Story</p>

        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="section-heading reveal delay-100 mb-6"
        >
          Bukan sekadar<br />
          <em class="italic text-caramel">tempat minum kopi.</em>
        </h2>

        <div class="about-body reveal delay-200">
          <p class="mb-5">
            Kami percaya bahwa kopi yang baik dimulai dari proses yang penuh
            perhatian — dari biji yang dipilih dengan cermat, disangrai dengan
            presisi, hingga diseduh dengan tangan yang sabar.
          </p>
          <p class="mb-5">
            [COFFEE SHOP NAME] lahir dari kecintaan terhadap specialty coffee
            dan keinginan untuk menciptakan ruang yang terasa seperti rumah —
            tempat di mana orang datang bukan hanya untuk kopi, tapi untuk
            memperlambat hari dan menikmati momen.
          </p>
          <p>
            Berlokasi di jantung [CITY], kami hadir setiap hari dari pagi
            hingga malam, siap menyambut kamu dengan secangkir kopi terbaik.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Values -->
        <ul class="about-values reveal delay-300" role="list">
          <li class="about-value-item">
            <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Specialty Grade</strong>
              <span>Biji kopi pilihan dari perkebunan terbaik Indonesia</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="about-value-item">
            <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
                <polyline points="12,6 12,12 16,14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Freshly Roasted</strong>
              <span>Disangrai setiap minggu untuk menjaga kesegaran</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="about-value-item">
            <div class="about-value-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <strong>Made with Care</strong>
              <span>Setiap minuman dibuat dengan penuh perhatian dan cinta</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-section {
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
  }

  /* Grid layout */
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
      gap: 5rem;
    }
  }

  /* Image column */
  .about-image-col {
    position: relative;
  }

  .about-image-wrap {
    position: relative;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    aspect-ratio: 4/5;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-image-wrap {
      aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    }
  }

  .about-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    transition: transform 0.8s ease;
  }

  .about-image-wrap:hover .about-img {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  /* Caption badge */
  .about-img-caption {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.5rem;
    right: 1.5rem;
    background-color: var(--color-cream);
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.2rem;
    border-radius: 9999px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  /* Accent image */
  .about-accent-img {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2rem;
    right: -1.5rem;
    width: 42%;
    border-radius: 4px;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid var(--color-cream);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(28,20,16,0.15);
    display: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-accent-img {
      display: block;
    }
  }

  .about-accent-img img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  /* Text column */
  .about-text-col {
    padding-block: 1rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about-text-col {
      padding-block: 2rem;
    }
  }

  /* Body text */
  .about-body p {
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Values list */
  .about-values {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .about-value-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .about-value-icon {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    background-color: var(--color-sand);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--color-brown);
    margin-top: 0.125rem;
  }

  .about-value-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-espresso);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .about-value-item span {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* Italic accent */
  .text-caramel {
    color: var(--color-caramel);
  }
</style>
